  partition dropped) and ~177 KiB of RAM against 32 KiB. The RAM that is left after the
  diet is structural (rclcpp::Node GlobalStorageHolder 83,880 B, zpico g_sessions, the
  nros_platform_zephyr_shims noinit pool 32,768 B, the kernel), not a knob default.

Not an emulator verdict: Renode's repl models the real sizes (32 KiB SRAM, 256 KiB
flash), and the board is resource-bound before Renode is asked anything.

